<h1>Why do I see F&M BASIC and not COMX BASIC?</h1>
<p>
One of the expansion box rom versions includes a screen editor designed by F&M, see also the help section on the <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/comx_expansion.html">Expansion Box</a>.
